    <!-- FAQ Content -->
    <string name="faq_q1">How to create a reminder?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">You can type in the top bar using natural language (e.g. \"Call Mom tomorrow at 7 PM\"), tap the 🎤 Voice button to speak, or tap \"+ Add Reminder\" to pick an exact date, time, category, and priority.</string>
    
    <string name="faq_q2">How to create recurring reminders?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">When creating or editing a reminder, choose the \"Repeat Frequency\" option. You can set it to Daily, Mon-Fri, Weekly, Monthly, or Yearly. When you complete a recurring reminder, the next occurrence is automatically scheduled for you!</string>
    
    <string name="faq_q3">How to use voice reminders?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Tap the 🎤 Voice button on the home screen. Speak clearly, for example: \"Tomorrow 8 PM, remind me to call Dad\" or \"Pay electricity bill on Friday 10 AM\". The app automatically understands the date, time, and category.</string>
    
    <string name="faq_q4">How to change language?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Tap the Settings (⚙️) icon in the top header and select your preferred language: English, Hindi, Punjabi, Odia, Gujarati, Bengali, Telugu, or Tamil. The entire app will switch instantly.</string>
    
    <string name="faq_q5">Does it work offline?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Yes, 100%! All your reminders are saved locally in the device database (Room) and scheduled through the native Android Alarm system. No internet connection is needed.</string>
    
